WEBVTT

01:38.640 --> 01:41.800
BASED ON THE NOVEL
"THE PRISONER OF BEAUTY" BY PENGLAI KE

01:45.880 --> 01:46.800
Grandfather,

01:47.800 --> 01:50.720
what kind of person is Wei Shao?

01:51.800 --> 01:54.840
You should learn about
his grandfather first.

01:55.760 --> 01:57.960
When I first became
the Governor of Yanzhou,

01:58.040 --> 02:00.800
I held a deer hunt,

02:01.880 --> 02:07.720
inviting lords of various states
to a hunting game.

02:07.800 --> 02:08.800
XIAOQIAO
QIAO GUI'S GRANDDAUGHTER

02:08.880 --> 02:10.720
But actually,

02:10.800 --> 02:14.120
I meant to make allies.

02:15.160 --> 02:16.480
We were

02:17.880 --> 02:20.760
like old friends from the start.

02:22.000 --> 02:23.520
KANGJUN, YANZHOU

02:23.600 --> 02:26.640
I can never repay you
for bringing us water

02:26.720 --> 02:28.000
through the canal.

02:28.560 --> 02:29.440
Now…

02:29.520 --> 02:30.320
QIAO GUI
GOVERNOR OF YANZHOU

02:30.400 --> 02:33.280
…let these antlers be the tokens
of our alliance…

02:33.360 --> 02:34.440
WEI LUN
THE LORD OF WEI

02:34.520 --> 02:35.840
…with Yanzhou.

02:35.920 --> 02:37.000
Lord Wei…

02:37.640 --> 02:38.880
From now on,

02:38.960 --> 02:42.320
whoever dares to invade Yanzhou
will be Wei's enemy.

02:43.480 --> 02:45.640
The Qiao and Wei clans

02:46.760 --> 02:48.160
will live and die

02:49.000 --> 02:50.160
together.

02:51.600 --> 02:53.120
As will we.

02:55.880 --> 02:57.720
In the following years,

02:58.920 --> 03:01.880
I built the Yongning Canal

03:01.960 --> 03:04.600
between Panyi and Xindu,

03:06.000 --> 03:07.160
allowing Wei

03:08.120 --> 03:09.840
to have water

03:09.920 --> 03:11.480
and us to have protection.

03:11.560 --> 03:12.440
PANORAMA

03:12.520 --> 03:14.120
14 years ago,

03:14.200 --> 03:16.320
Bianzhou sent Li Su to invade Wei…

03:16.400 --> 03:18.400
14 YEARS AGO, XINDU, WEI STATE
WEI BAO, 1ST GRANDSON OF WEI LUN

03:18.480 --> 03:21.600
…and seize Xindu to break our alliance.

03:22.120 --> 03:23.520
Grandfather,

03:23.600 --> 03:25.000
the Qiao clan has sent no one.

03:25.080 --> 03:26.440
They must've turned their backs on us!

03:27.560 --> 03:30.720
That rat Qiao Gui!

03:35.920 --> 03:39.120
Are you going to drag us into war
for a verbal alliance?

03:40.840 --> 03:41.920
Father,

03:42.000 --> 03:44.800
we've offered Wei enough supplies
over the years

03:44.880 --> 03:46.800
for the sake of your friendship
with their lord.

03:46.880 --> 03:47.800
We promised to send troops.

03:47.880 --> 03:48.800
QIAO YUE
QIAO GUI'S 1ST SON

03:48.880 --> 03:49.760
Withdrawing them is betrayal!

03:49.840 --> 03:50.800
QIAO PING
QIAO GUI'S 2ND SON

03:50.880 --> 03:52.440
We can use a pretext.

03:53.120 --> 03:53.840
Father,

03:53.920 --> 03:55.960
please make a decision immediately.

04:00.600 --> 04:01.680
YOUNG XIAOQIAO

04:01.760 --> 04:05.440
Manman just threw moon blocks
for divination.

04:05.520 --> 04:07.480
This is the will of Heaven.

04:08.200 --> 04:08.960
Withdraw!

04:09.040 --> 04:09.800
Father!

04:16.320 --> 04:17.440
Shao, don't cry.

04:17.519 --> 04:18.480
YOUNG WEI SHAO

04:18.560 --> 04:19.600
Shao,

04:19.680 --> 04:20.640
remember this.

04:21.120 --> 04:22.680
Do not trust anyone.

04:23.240 --> 04:25.160
Grandfather was tricked by the Qiao clan.

04:25.240 --> 04:26.560
That's how he ended up like this.

04:32.360 --> 04:34.280
You carry the hopes of the Wei family.

04:37.480 --> 04:38.640
Brother, promise me

04:40.920 --> 04:42.440
not to shed tears ever again.

04:56.880 --> 04:57.720
Father!

05:04.160 --> 05:06.600
This city belongs to Bianzhou now.

05:06.680 --> 05:07.840
It's Chen's.

05:12.120 --> 05:13.480
Throw them into the pit

05:13.560 --> 05:15.040
and bury them with the captives.

05:15.120 --> 05:15.960
LI SU, GENERAL OF BIANZHOU

05:16.040 --> 05:18.120
Kill all men in Xindu
in the next three days!

05:18.200 --> 05:19.200
Yes.

05:49.240 --> 05:53.440
You meant to protect Yanzhou
from war, didn't you?

05:54.320 --> 05:57.440
To sacrifice one or all?

05:58.160 --> 06:00.480
It would've been hard
for me to choose too.

06:01.320 --> 06:06.040
Wei Shao and his troops have come
to recapture Xindu from Li Su.

06:06.760 --> 06:09.320
At this point,
if we send our troops to assist Li Su,

06:09.400 --> 06:11.280
Wei Shao might not win.

06:11.360 --> 06:12.920
But if we do nothing,

06:13.000 --> 06:14.920
and he captures Xindu,

06:15.000 --> 06:18.280
he'll invade Yanzhou next and seize Panyi.

06:18.360 --> 06:19.840
What to do then?

06:20.800 --> 06:23.560
The late Lord of Wei's wife,

06:25.240 --> 06:26.520
Lady Xu…

06:26.600 --> 06:27.640
LADY XU
WEI SHAO'S GRANDMOTHER

06:27.720 --> 06:29.520
…is far-sighted.

06:31.120 --> 06:33.800
I'd like her approval
for a marriage alliance

06:34.320 --> 06:36.360
to bury the hatchet.

06:38.480 --> 06:41.000
Is it to marry my cousin to Wei Shao?

06:43.680 --> 06:46.120
If such a marriage alliance

06:46.200 --> 06:47.400
can resolve hatred,

06:48.160 --> 06:50.240
that'll be good.

06:50.800 --> 06:54.440
But Wei Shao saw his grandfather,
father, and brother being killed.

06:55.160 --> 06:59.120
We have no idea if he bears grudges
against the Qiao clan.

07:00.880 --> 07:02.000
I wonder

07:03.040 --> 07:05.000
what exactly he's like.

07:08.200 --> 07:12.200
WEI SHAO
THE LORD OF WEI

07:15.800 --> 07:19.080
KANGJUN, YANZHOU

07:20.560 --> 07:22.240
Here, toss! Over here!

07:22.320 --> 07:23.520
Toss it over!

07:23.600 --> 07:24.720
- Try and hit me too!
- Here.

07:24.800 --> 07:26.800
Give me that.

07:26.880 --> 07:28.240
You hit me!

07:29.240 --> 07:30.160
Hit her!

07:30.240 --> 07:31.280
DAQIAO, QIAO YUE'S DAUGHTER

07:31.360 --> 07:32.320
Good. Over here.

07:32.400 --> 07:34.960
- My turn.
- Hit her! Come on!

07:35.040 --> 07:35.920
Stop!

07:36.000 --> 07:36.760
Hit me if you can.

07:36.840 --> 07:38.080
- Toss it to me.
- Catch it!

07:38.160 --> 07:38.920
BI ZHI, GROOM

07:39.360 --> 07:41.080
Wait. Time-out.

07:41.160 --> 07:42.080
Let me try it.

07:42.160 --> 07:42.960
It's my turn.

07:52.360 --> 07:53.400
Manman.

07:54.360 --> 07:55.880
- Give me that.
- Manman.

07:58.920 --> 08:00.160
Manman,

08:00.840 --> 08:02.840
what's been troubling you lately?

08:02.920 --> 08:04.520
Can't you tell me about it?

08:08.040 --> 08:10.600
Wei Shao has had Xindu besieged for days.

08:11.000 --> 08:12.800
I wonder how things are there.

08:12.880 --> 08:14.440
You don't seem worried at all.

08:15.160 --> 08:17.480
Wei Shao's target is Xindu, not our city.

08:17.560 --> 08:18.960
Why bother worrying?

08:19.040 --> 08:21.720
Won't he attack us after seizing Xindu?

08:21.800 --> 08:22.840
Will he?

08:25.480 --> 08:26.920
Bi Zhi, toss it over!

08:36.000 --> 08:37.159
Cousin,

08:37.760 --> 08:39.840
the only way to keep Yanzhou from war

08:40.440 --> 08:41.840
is to form a marriage alliance.

08:43.400 --> 08:44.440
In that case,

08:45.200 --> 08:46.840
you'll be married to Wei Shao.

08:47.760 --> 08:50.120
Me? Marry Wei Shao?

08:50.200 --> 08:51.800
QIAO MANSION, YANZHOU

08:51.880 --> 08:54.360
Liangya's heir, Liu Yan,
came with one of his uncles.

08:54.440 --> 08:55.200
XIAOZAO
XIAOQIAO'S MAID

08:55.280 --> 08:58.000
His father sent an envoy
to propose marriage to you.

08:58.080 --> 08:59.320
I am

08:59.400 --> 09:03.760
the envoy sent by Liangya's royal family
to propose marriage with betrothal gifts.

09:03.840 --> 09:04.680
LIU SHAN, LIU YAN'S UNCLE

09:04.760 --> 09:06.680
I heard a tale on the way.

09:06.760 --> 09:08.080
I wonder if it's true.

09:08.160 --> 09:08.920
LIU YAN, LIANGYA'S HEIR

09:09.000 --> 09:12.120
Back when Lord Qiao Yue
married you, Lady Ding…

09:12.200 --> 09:13.160
LADY DING
QIAO YUE'S WIFE

09:13.240 --> 09:16.280
…your dowry
was worth 10,000 taels of gold.

09:16.720 --> 09:18.880
It spread for miles on the streets.

09:20.120 --> 09:23.760
If our heir is to marry Miss Xiaoqiao,

09:23.840 --> 09:24.680
Governor,

09:25.280 --> 09:27.080
will her dowry include a fief?

09:31.760 --> 09:32.760
Uncle…

09:34.880 --> 09:35.800
Young Master,

09:36.240 --> 09:37.920
once Wei Shao seizes Xindu,

09:38.400 --> 09:40.680
Yanzhou will be in danger.

09:42.080 --> 09:43.640
You probably don't know

09:44.120 --> 09:48.200
that my father and Lady Xu
of the Wei clan of Wei

09:49.240 --> 09:52.000
have agreed to marry my daughter, Daqiao,
to the Lord of Wei.

09:52.920 --> 09:55.280
He'll be my son-in-law.

09:56.000 --> 09:58.680
If Young Master Liu
marries my niece, Xiaoqiao,

09:59.960 --> 10:02.440
you and the Lord of Wei
will be in-laws too.

10:02.520 --> 10:04.240
How could we be in danger?

10:07.720 --> 10:08.560
Uncle,

10:09.360 --> 10:11.040
I struggled in misery in childhood.

10:11.120 --> 10:13.320
I couldn't have come this far
without you two's help.

10:14.480 --> 10:15.640
Cousin Xiaoqiao and I

10:16.360 --> 10:17.520
grew up together.

10:18.400 --> 10:19.280
See?

10:19.360 --> 10:22.960
Our heir has always been
grateful and loyal.

10:23.720 --> 10:25.240
In this case,

10:25.320 --> 10:27.880
how about we set the wedding date today

10:28.760 --> 10:30.840
for these childhood sweethearts?

10:32.000 --> 10:32.760
Here.

10:33.280 --> 10:34.160
I toast you all.

10:34.640 --> 10:39.080
Liangya's royal family's betrothal gifts
for their heir, Liu Yan,

10:39.160 --> 10:41.200
include a pair of wild geese,

10:41.280 --> 10:42.640
one million coppers,

10:42.720 --> 10:44.400
ten duan of silk,

10:44.480 --> 10:45.920
twelve hu of baijiu,

10:46.000 --> 10:47.640
twelve hu of rice,

10:47.720 --> 10:49.600
twelve hu of proso millet,

10:49.680 --> 10:50.880
two sheepskins,

10:50.960 --> 10:52.600
and a lynx.

10:58.600 --> 10:59.880
That's a lynx?

10:59.960 --> 11:00.760
XIAOTAO
XIAOQIAO'S MAID

11:00.840 --> 11:02.400
It looks more like a weasel.

11:05.800 --> 11:06.680
It is a weasel.

11:12.280 --> 11:13.800
You probably don't know

11:13.880 --> 11:16.080
how hard it is to get a lynx.

11:16.760 --> 11:19.360
We didn't have time to hunt one

11:19.440 --> 11:22.040
while rushing all the way here.

11:22.120 --> 11:23.400
Besides,

11:23.480 --> 11:25.720
don't most families use weasels?

11:25.800 --> 11:27.440
We aren't just any family.

11:30.720 --> 11:31.560
Yes.

11:33.760 --> 11:35.480
Sure.

11:39.280 --> 11:40.160
How's everything going, Uncle?

11:40.240 --> 11:42.200
Offering them a weasel is good enough.

11:42.280 --> 11:43.800
A lynx is hard to come by.

11:44.280 --> 11:45.240
Manman,

11:46.080 --> 11:47.920
Liu Yan's feelings for you

11:48.000 --> 11:49.680
matter more than such formalities.

11:50.360 --> 11:53.000
You've been bonded since childhood.

11:55.360 --> 11:56.880
Unlike your cousin,

11:58.000 --> 12:00.440
who'll be married into a deathtrap.

12:01.360 --> 12:03.520
WEI LIANG, GENERAL OF WEI

12:04.840 --> 12:06.560
WEI QU, GENERAL OF WEI

12:08.880 --> 12:11.080
WEI XIAO, GENERAL OF WEI

12:12.160 --> 12:14.400
WEI DUO, GENERAL OF WEI

12:22.400 --> 12:23.240
Guys,

12:24.240 --> 12:25.120
shall we eat or not?

12:25.200 --> 12:27.040
Cut it! I'm starving!

12:27.120 --> 12:28.160
Hurry!

12:28.240 --> 12:29.040
Have a bite.

12:29.120 --> 12:30.400
Add seasoning.

12:30.480 --> 12:33.880
My lord, our feet get itchy
when we can't fight.

12:33.960 --> 12:35.200
Xindu is right ahead.

12:35.280 --> 12:36.640
Can't we charge into it?

12:36.720 --> 12:37.800
Or do you think we can't?

12:37.880 --> 12:39.800
Besiegement is better than attack.

12:39.880 --> 12:42.120
The Central Plains region
always struggles with drought.

12:42.200 --> 12:44.000
Li Su doesn't have enough provisions.

12:44.080 --> 12:46.720
We can seize Xindu without battle.

12:46.800 --> 12:47.760
Be patient.

12:50.800 --> 12:52.520
What are you doing?

12:52.600 --> 12:54.120
They lack food, don't they?

12:54.200 --> 12:56.320
I'm letting them know that
not only do we have food

12:56.400 --> 12:57.880
but we also have meat to eat.

12:59.080 --> 13:00.040
My lord.

13:00.120 --> 13:01.080
Advisor.

13:01.160 --> 13:02.240
- Advisor.
- Advisor.

13:02.560 --> 13:03.440
GONGSUN YANG
WEI SHAO'S ADVISOR

13:03.520 --> 13:05.400
My lord, Lady Xu sent a letter.

13:05.480 --> 13:06.760
What did my grandmother say?

13:07.240 --> 13:10.240
She wants to marry a girl to you.

13:10.600 --> 13:12.720
I have sworn to my grandfather

13:12.800 --> 13:14.360
to kill Li Su and the Qiao clan.

13:15.200 --> 13:16.480
I won't marry anyone

13:17.600 --> 13:18.520
until I take my revenge.

13:19.120 --> 13:19.960
Yes.

13:21.400 --> 13:22.680
Whisper to me.

13:22.760 --> 13:24.920
Who did Lady Xu pick to marry our lord?

13:25.000 --> 13:26.120
What does she look like?

13:26.200 --> 13:27.400
Let's see it! Come on!

13:27.480 --> 13:29.480
Qiao of the Qiao clan.

13:30.200 --> 13:31.600
Qiao of the Qiao clan?

13:33.280 --> 13:34.080
Calm down.

13:34.160 --> 13:35.480
MR. GONGSUN, WE CAN
RESOLVE HATRED BY MARRIAGE.

13:35.560 --> 13:36.880
Think about it.

13:36.960 --> 13:40.040
After seizing all those cities
and getting to Xindu,

13:40.120 --> 13:41.400
our troops will need to rest.

13:41.480 --> 13:44.080
If we are caught between Qiao's
and Li Su's troops,

13:45.280 --> 13:47.280
we might be in grave peril.

13:48.360 --> 13:49.440
How dare…

13:50.920 --> 13:52.400
those traitors push my grandmother!

13:52.480 --> 13:55.360
If I seize Xindu now,

13:56.320 --> 13:57.320
then she'll have

13:58.440 --> 14:00.840
nothing to worry about, right?

14:02.520 --> 14:03.360
Guys,

14:04.120 --> 14:04.800
move it!

14:05.200 --> 14:06.000
My lord!

14:06.080 --> 14:06.840
My lord!

14:06.920 --> 14:09.360
A reckless raid is likely to fail!

14:16.000 --> 14:18.400
WEI

14:26.120 --> 14:27.480
Fourteen years ago,

14:28.640 --> 14:30.320
the Qiao clan betrayed our family,

14:31.480 --> 14:33.040
causing them to be killed

14:33.960 --> 14:35.520
and Xindu to be captured.

14:36.360 --> 14:37.400
The enemy

14:38.320 --> 14:39.680
is right in front of us.

14:40.960 --> 14:42.240
Everyone,

14:42.720 --> 14:44.040
let's go

14:44.120 --> 14:45.440
to kill Li Su

14:45.520 --> 14:46.520
and the Qiao clan!

14:46.840 --> 14:48.880
Kill Li Su and the Qiao clan!

14:48.960 --> 14:51.120
Kill Li Su and the Qiao clan!

14:51.200 --> 14:53.160
Kill Li Su and the Qiao clan!

14:53.240 --> 14:55.120
Kill Li Su and the Qiao clan!

14:55.200 --> 14:55.880
XINDU

14:55.960 --> 14:57.720
Kill Li Su and the Qiao clan!

14:57.800 --> 14:59.920
Kill Li Su and the Qiao clan!

15:00.000 --> 15:01.000
Let's go!

15:13.200 --> 15:15.200
Wei Shao, you brat! I'll kill you!

15:28.960 --> 15:32.720
THIS SCENE IS REQUIRED BY THE PLOT.
DO NOT IMITATE. BE KIND TO ANIMALS.

16:03.640 --> 16:04.640
Charge!

16:13.360 --> 16:14.160
XINDU

16:28.520 --> 16:31.440
QIAO MANSION

16:39.560 --> 16:40.560
Manman,

16:41.800 --> 16:42.840
don't worry.

16:44.000 --> 16:45.720
Yanzhou is your home.

16:48.600 --> 16:50.080
Once Wei Shao and I marry,

16:51.120 --> 16:53.280
Liangya will treat you with great respect.

17:37.840 --> 17:38.760
Fan.

17:40.720 --> 17:42.400
As much as I hate to marry Wei Shao,

17:43.680 --> 17:45.640
I can't elope with you either.

17:51.000 --> 17:51.960
Bi Zhi,

17:55.440 --> 17:57.040
we'll have to part soon.

17:59.840 --> 18:00.880
Wei Shao…

18:02.480 --> 18:04.360
I'll challenge him to a duel

18:04.440 --> 18:06.160
to stop him from marrying you.

18:07.320 --> 18:09.880
A mere groom like you

18:09.960 --> 18:11.640
will be no match for him.

18:24.720 --> 18:25.480
You're up.

18:27.000 --> 18:28.000
I can't sleep.

18:31.920 --> 18:34.000
I have something to discuss with you.

18:35.320 --> 18:36.360
What is it?

18:38.480 --> 18:39.760
After the New Year,

18:39.840 --> 18:42.560
Chunniang and I used our spare time

18:43.520 --> 18:45.240
to sew this wedding gown for you.

18:47.000 --> 18:49.640
Now that Wei Shao and I
are engaged in haste,

18:49.720 --> 18:51.520
I'll leave before you.

18:53.640 --> 18:55.040
May I

18:55.120 --> 18:57.360
wear this instead?

19:05.960 --> 19:08.600
Both of us are getting married.

19:10.440 --> 19:12.680
How come your dowry is more than mine?

19:16.800 --> 19:19.920
I'll tell my mother to give you more.

19:20.000 --> 19:22.560
Or you can just take
whatever you like from my dowry.

19:24.760 --> 19:26.720
I'm not competing with you.

19:27.080 --> 19:30.800
It's just that once we part,

19:31.160 --> 19:33.080
we're unlikely to meet again.

19:33.880 --> 19:37.080
I'd like to keep something you value
as a memento.

19:37.160 --> 19:39.280
Whenever I miss you,
I can look at it for comfort.

19:42.240 --> 19:44.200
Don't you want these clothes?

19:44.280 --> 19:45.400
Here you go.

19:47.240 --> 19:48.080
Anything else?

19:50.360 --> 19:51.960
You can have these too.

19:52.640 --> 19:53.640
Is there more?

19:55.840 --> 19:57.920
I sewed these myself.

19:58.000 --> 19:59.160
I haven't worn them yet.

19:59.720 --> 20:00.800
What else?

20:01.960 --> 20:06.160
I mean, by giving me
those things you cherish,

20:06.240 --> 20:08.240
you can show how much you love me.

20:20.520 --> 20:22.440
No, not that one.

20:30.720 --> 20:31.760
Trust me.

20:33.400 --> 20:34.560
I'll keep

20:35.400 --> 20:36.640
all of these safe.

20:37.760 --> 20:40.360
I'll give you whatever you want

20:42.040 --> 20:45.040
as long as you can live happily
with your husband.

20:48.440 --> 20:49.640
As will you.

20:53.920 --> 20:55.200
Between the two of us,

20:55.720 --> 20:58.640
if you can have a happy marriage,

20:59.440 --> 21:00.520
that'll be enough.

21:03.800 --> 21:05.240
Between the two of us,

21:06.960 --> 21:09.680
if one can have a happy marriage,

21:10.560 --> 21:11.800
that'll be enough.

21:25.600 --> 21:26.520
Get changed.

21:27.280 --> 21:28.720
I'll take you to a place.

21:30.400 --> 21:33.080
- Manman, where are we going?
- Hurry!

21:33.920 --> 21:34.760
Manman, what…?

21:34.840 --> 21:36.400
What are you doing?

21:43.200 --> 21:44.560
If you truly love him,

21:45.160 --> 21:46.480
then go with him.

21:50.320 --> 21:51.280
I can't.

21:51.360 --> 21:52.640
You have to.

21:53.080 --> 21:55.120
If you marry Wei Shao,
your life will be ruined.

21:55.200 --> 21:57.080
I'm the governor's daughter.

21:57.160 --> 21:59.240
I've been supported by our people.

21:59.320 --> 22:00.800
It's time for me to take responsibility.

22:01.680 --> 22:03.080
If I say

22:04.720 --> 22:06.640
that I'll marry Wei Shao instead,

22:06.720 --> 22:07.640
will you allow it?

22:07.720 --> 22:08.880
You can't!

22:08.960 --> 22:11.280
- He…
- He's the worst. I know.

22:11.360 --> 22:12.640
Listen.

22:12.720 --> 22:14.520
A woman's marriage can only go two ways.

22:15.360 --> 22:16.800
One is your way,

22:16.880 --> 22:20.880
to grow old with your love
and lead a normal life.

22:21.640 --> 22:23.040
The other is mine.

22:23.800 --> 22:26.480
I don't need my husband's sweet love,

22:26.560 --> 22:27.880
but his status and power.

22:29.880 --> 22:31.720
I used to like Young Master Liu,

22:32.320 --> 22:33.920
but now,

22:34.000 --> 22:36.000
I realize he doesn't deserve me.

22:37.440 --> 22:40.760
He looks down on Yanzhou and me
for fear of Wei Shao.

22:41.480 --> 22:44.280
So in that case,
why don't I marry Wei Shao

22:45.680 --> 22:47.840
and make the Liu clan of Liangya
bow to me?

22:53.920 --> 22:56.080
If you didn't hide anything,

22:56.160 --> 22:58.920
you must've given me
all your valuable things.

23:00.040 --> 23:02.440
Your konghou is too heavy,

23:03.280 --> 23:05.240
so I took off its strings for you.

23:06.120 --> 23:07.680
You won't blame me, will you?

23:11.160 --> 23:12.080
Manman, you…

23:14.080 --> 23:14.920
Manman!

23:22.480 --> 23:23.440
Manman…

23:26.400 --> 23:27.080
Sit tight.

23:27.160 --> 23:31.360
I'm helping her elope with you
to keep her from harm's way.

23:32.800 --> 23:36.680
But if I find out you mistreated her,
I'll hunt you down for sure.

23:38.520 --> 23:40.720
If you do love her wholeheartedly,

23:42.440 --> 23:43.800
then when the time's right,

23:44.560 --> 23:47.680
I'll put in a good word to her parents

23:47.760 --> 23:48.880
and help you rise.

23:50.880 --> 23:52.840
Miss, if you need my help in the future,

23:53.600 --> 23:56.560
I, Bi Zhi, will go through
fire and water for you!

24:04.120 --> 24:05.120
Manman!

24:08.200 --> 24:09.400
Set out now,

24:11.640 --> 24:12.720
before it's too late.

24:13.120 --> 24:14.120
Manman!

24:14.200 --> 24:15.080
Manman!

24:15.160 --> 24:15.960
Bi Zhi.

24:17.640 --> 24:18.520
Manman!

24:18.600 --> 24:19.560
Manman!

24:28.360 --> 24:30.360
She's unsophisticated.

24:30.440 --> 24:33.720
Leaving with Bi Zhi is much better

24:33.800 --> 24:36.960
than marrying the Lord of Wei
only to be torn to pieces.

24:39.640 --> 24:42.720
Miss, what are you going to do next?

24:47.200 --> 24:48.680
Check the stable again. Go!

24:48.760 --> 24:49.920
- Yes.
- What about her room?

24:50.000 --> 24:50.760
- Not yet.
- My Lady!

24:50.840 --> 24:52.320
- Go now!
- Yes.

24:52.400 --> 24:53.880
Miss Daqiao left a letter.

24:55.120 --> 24:56.000
What happened?

24:56.080 --> 24:56.960
Where is she?

24:57.040 --> 24:57.840
Where is she?!

24:58.600 --> 24:59.440
Darling.

25:01.960 --> 25:05.120
FAREWELL, MOTHER. DO TAKE CARE.

25:05.200 --> 25:06.760
What to do?

25:06.840 --> 25:09.600
If Fan is gone,
who will marry the Lord of Wei?

25:09.680 --> 25:11.320
The Letter of Marriage has been sent.

25:11.400 --> 25:13.360
Lady Xu has given her approval.

25:13.440 --> 25:15.840
If the Lord of Wei
attacks us for the breach,

25:15.920 --> 25:17.800
what… what should we do?

25:17.880 --> 25:19.200
We'll fight to the end!

25:19.280 --> 25:20.160
ZHANG PU, QIAO YUE'S AIDE

25:20.240 --> 25:23.000
Ci, look at our clansmen.

25:23.080 --> 25:24.600
Can any of them fight?

25:25.680 --> 25:26.760
I suggest

25:26.840 --> 25:29.760
we send Zhang Pu to Xindu

25:30.320 --> 25:33.320
to tell the Lord of Wei the truth
and make an apology.

25:33.400 --> 25:38.000
What? I can't handle the wrath
of the Lord of Wei.

25:38.080 --> 25:39.000
Tell him…

25:40.280 --> 25:43.960
tell him Fan was abducted on her way to…

25:44.040 --> 25:44.960
the temple!

25:45.040 --> 25:47.280
That's a terrible idea, my lord!

25:47.360 --> 25:49.480
Wei's troops are formidable.

25:49.560 --> 25:51.480
I can't go there alone.

25:51.560 --> 25:53.720
It's walking into the jaws of death,
my lord!

26:12.360 --> 26:15.320
My lord, I have a solution.

26:15.400 --> 26:16.080
Say it.

26:16.160 --> 26:17.880
Now that Miss Daqiao is gone,

26:19.440 --> 26:20.680
why not…?

26:24.720 --> 26:26.320
Do you mean…

26:26.400 --> 26:27.640
marry Manman to him?

26:28.920 --> 26:30.040
Brilliant!

26:30.480 --> 26:31.440
- Darling.
- Nonsense!

26:31.520 --> 26:32.480
Are you out of your mind?

26:32.560 --> 26:34.040
Good.

26:34.120 --> 26:35.880
That's perfect.

26:35.960 --> 26:38.400
She and Liu Yan are engaged.

26:38.480 --> 26:40.480
Wei is strong while Liangya is weak.

26:40.560 --> 26:43.960
We can't afford to annoy Wei
or we'll meet our doom!

26:44.440 --> 26:47.200
Brother, don't you know Wei Shao?

26:47.280 --> 26:49.080
If we marry Manman to him,

26:49.160 --> 26:50.800
won't we be pushing her off the cliff?

26:50.880 --> 26:52.120
Do you have a better idea?

26:52.200 --> 26:55.560
The priority is to find Fan
and bring her back.

27:00.800 --> 27:03.040
Fate can't be avoided.

27:03.880 --> 27:06.280
XINDU, WEI STATE

27:18.800 --> 27:21.040
Fourteen years ago,

27:21.880 --> 27:24.440
I ordered a three-day massacre,

27:25.080 --> 27:28.440
yet you managed to survive.

27:34.200 --> 27:35.680
Are you curious

27:37.120 --> 27:38.680
about how I escaped death?

27:55.320 --> 27:57.680
Back then,

27:57.760 --> 27:59.840
I killed your grandfather, father,

27:59.920 --> 28:01.720
and brother.

28:05.560 --> 28:06.680
Too bad

28:07.360 --> 28:09.920
I only have one life.

28:12.880 --> 28:14.440
It was worth it!

28:14.520 --> 28:15.840
Really!

28:16.800 --> 28:18.680
Lord, what should we do with him?

28:18.760 --> 28:19.480
Kill him.

28:19.560 --> 28:21.240
That's too easy for him.

28:32.640 --> 28:34.240
Throw his pieces into a case.

29:11.280 --> 29:13.480
Stop!

29:13.760 --> 29:14.840
My lord!

29:14.920 --> 29:16.360
Don't kill him!

29:16.440 --> 29:17.400
Advisor.

29:22.240 --> 29:23.200
Chopped and done.

29:31.400 --> 29:33.560
PEOPLE'S WALL

29:33.640 --> 29:35.600
That was reckless, my lord.

29:35.680 --> 29:38.280
Everyone knows the feud
between you and him.

29:38.360 --> 29:41.040
If you had kept Li Su alive,
you'd have gained public support.

29:42.160 --> 29:44.080
What use have I for that?

29:45.960 --> 29:47.760
What I wanted was Li Su's death.

29:49.040 --> 29:50.720
Although you've seized Xindu,

29:51.400 --> 29:52.760
restoring it

29:52.840 --> 29:54.720
requires the help of the people.

29:56.160 --> 29:57.560
Fourteen years ago,

29:57.640 --> 29:59.360
after the massacre by Li Su,

29:59.440 --> 30:01.040
the old and young who were left

30:01.120 --> 30:03.600
built this wall
with their families' belongings

30:04.280 --> 30:05.560
to honor the deceased.

30:06.880 --> 30:08.440
It's been so long.

30:08.520 --> 30:11.280
The war has taken a heavy toll on them.

30:11.360 --> 30:13.400
- A wedding at this time could…
- I know.

30:14.920 --> 30:18.400
You want me to get married

30:20.240 --> 30:21.600
for the greater good, right?

30:22.080 --> 30:23.080
My lord,

30:23.640 --> 30:27.440
our troops have to recuperate now.

30:27.520 --> 30:29.080
No further action should be taken.

30:34.720 --> 30:36.840
I disagree with you.

30:38.120 --> 30:39.760
It's better to press on…

30:42.480 --> 30:43.560
to seize Panyi.

30:45.400 --> 30:46.400
Manman.

30:48.840 --> 30:51.960
You grew up under my watch.

30:52.040 --> 30:53.560
With your intelligence,

30:54.640 --> 30:56.280
you may or may not go far,

30:57.160 --> 30:59.360
but you can at least protect yourself.

31:02.160 --> 31:03.280
Grandfather,

31:04.960 --> 31:06.240
I'm thinking

31:06.920 --> 31:10.520
that to make the Lord of Wei
ally himself with us as I wish,

31:11.560 --> 31:14.960
we need to find out what he wants from me.

31:16.360 --> 31:20.600
Panyi is the gateway of Yanzhou,
crisscrossed with rivers.

31:21.520 --> 31:23.560
If Wei Shao means to seize Yanzhou,

31:23.640 --> 31:25.600
Panyi will be his first target.

31:26.480 --> 31:29.400
If I offer it as my dowry,

31:29.480 --> 31:31.280
he'll certainly marry me, right?

31:40.960 --> 31:43.960
You're smarter than your uncle
and your father.

31:45.200 --> 31:47.760
Too bad you're a girl.

31:47.840 --> 31:49.280
I can't keep you.

31:54.640 --> 31:55.560
Manman…

32:05.680 --> 32:11.560
Did Heaven mean to bless
or punish the Qiao clan,

32:13.160 --> 32:15.120
that it gave a talent like you to us?

32:26.000 --> 32:28.080
What else should I know, Grandfather?

32:29.800 --> 32:30.760
Be good

32:32.160 --> 32:33.200
to him

32:33.280 --> 32:34.280
and the Wei clan,

32:36.640 --> 32:37.720
all right?

32:44.960 --> 32:47.640
The debt I owe from 14 years ago…

32:50.240 --> 32:53.320
has to be repaid by you.

33:24.960 --> 33:27.360
Here's the Seal of Panyi.

33:27.440 --> 33:29.680
Keep it safe.

33:36.800 --> 33:38.160
Thank you, Uncle.

33:41.600 --> 33:42.560
Manman,

33:43.160 --> 33:44.120
don't blame me.

33:45.600 --> 33:46.640
I won't.

34:06.480 --> 34:07.360
Manman,

34:08.719 --> 34:09.800
write to us regularly.

34:54.159 --> 34:56.920
QIAO

35:07.880 --> 35:10.560
Water is the softest thing in the world.

35:10.640 --> 35:12.360
I've been taming it my whole life.

35:12.440 --> 35:15.160
Overcome hardness with softness.

35:16.400 --> 35:17.800
Keep that in mind

35:18.440 --> 35:20.320
and you'll live.

35:21.480 --> 35:25.760
If the Lord of Wei is captivated by you,

35:27.120 --> 35:33.080
don't forget to gain more benefits
for Yanzhou.

35:46.200 --> 35:47.280
My lord,

35:47.360 --> 35:51.240
the provisions, troops, and horses in town
have been counted and registered.

35:54.880 --> 35:55.960
What about the households?

35:57.040 --> 35:59.960
The locals, they…
they refuse to cooperate.

36:00.800 --> 36:01.480
Why?

36:01.560 --> 36:05.280
They must've been misled
by Li Su's nonsense.

36:05.360 --> 36:07.680
Forget it. It's not important.

36:09.520 --> 36:11.840
That's fine.
They'll come around in a while.

36:13.080 --> 36:14.040
My lord!

36:15.600 --> 36:16.600
My lord,

36:16.680 --> 36:18.720
the Qiao's wedding procession is
about to reach the city gate.

36:21.480 --> 36:23.640
QIAO

36:32.680 --> 36:34.320
Are you seeking death?

36:35.080 --> 36:36.640
You're handing yourself to me on a plate.

36:36.720 --> 36:37.960
My bow!

36:38.040 --> 36:39.000
My lord.

36:55.640 --> 36:56.960
My lord, wait!

36:57.360 --> 36:58.440
Hold on.

36:59.080 --> 37:01.480
The Qiao clan means to make peace.

37:01.560 --> 37:04.320
Why not go along with them
and marry that girl?

37:05.000 --> 37:06.840
You'll gain Panyi.

37:20.200 --> 37:21.280
Gain Panyi?

37:21.360 --> 37:23.320
Without striking a blow.

37:23.400 --> 37:25.040
It's too good a deal.

37:25.120 --> 37:27.080
Think twice, my lord.

37:38.680 --> 37:40.960
Is her dowry that generous?

37:42.880 --> 37:46.320
XINDU

37:46.400 --> 37:50.800
"The waters are too beautiful
thanks to the pretty duo."

37:51.480 --> 37:52.880
The "pretty duo"

37:52.960 --> 37:55.520
refers to Qiao's two girls.

37:58.080 --> 38:00.200
XINDU

38:19.120 --> 38:20.120
Let them in.

38:21.680 --> 38:22.720
Open the gate!

38:28.680 --> 38:33.200
XINDU

38:37.440 --> 38:41.040
Tomorrow, we'll negotiate the marriage
with their envoy.

38:41.120 --> 38:43.360
Why not get some rest, my lord?

38:45.080 --> 38:47.680
I asked to see you for that matter.

38:49.320 --> 38:51.120
Xindu needs rejuvenation.

38:51.640 --> 38:56.000
The priority is to gather the locals
to rebuild defense works.

38:56.920 --> 39:00.360
This isn't the time for marriage.

39:03.960 --> 39:06.320
Those two things aren't contradictory.

39:09.160 --> 39:10.880
Think about it, my lord.

39:11.920 --> 39:15.400
Picture the forces
on the Central Plains as a whole.

39:15.480 --> 39:17.520
Don't they look like a deer?

39:19.800 --> 39:22.440
Yanzhou is the head.

39:22.520 --> 39:24.200
Wei is the belly.

39:24.280 --> 39:26.320
Bianzhou makes the spine.

39:26.400 --> 39:29.120
And Liangya becomes the hooves.

39:29.200 --> 39:33.640
Panyi stands much higher
as the gateway of Yanzhou.

39:33.720 --> 39:36.160
Doesn't it resemble that deer's heart?

39:36.240 --> 39:38.000
YANZHOU, WEI, BIANZHOU,
LIANGYA, PANYI

39:42.000 --> 39:45.640
Yanzhou will offer us the heart

39:46.280 --> 39:48.400
only if we become allies.

39:48.480 --> 39:49.960
That's the price to pay.

39:53.320 --> 39:56.560
If she hands over Panyi to me,

39:57.160 --> 39:58.480
I won't kill her.

39:58.560 --> 40:00.200
That's the best I can do.

40:05.080 --> 40:07.240
Your name precedes you, Mr. Gongsun.

40:07.320 --> 40:08.840
I admire you.

40:08.920 --> 40:09.840
We've finally met.

40:09.920 --> 40:12.080
You really are one of a kind.

40:12.160 --> 40:13.480
I'm flattered.

40:13.560 --> 40:16.560
I'm not as talented as you, Mr. Zhang.

40:17.320 --> 40:20.920
Yanzhou is indeed a land
of talent and bliss.

40:21.600 --> 40:25.040
Panyi especially
is well-known for its waters.

40:25.920 --> 40:28.400
I had a chance to visit it years back.

40:28.480 --> 40:30.200
It's been so long.

40:30.280 --> 40:32.720
I wonder how it looks now.

40:32.800 --> 40:35.160
You know, it happens to be
part of the dowry

40:35.240 --> 40:36.880
our lord prepared for Miss Xiaoqiao.

40:36.960 --> 40:40.080
After the wedding,
you may come along to visit it again.

40:40.640 --> 40:42.120
That'd be great.

40:42.200 --> 40:43.480
If that's the case,

40:44.240 --> 40:47.640
why not hold the wedding there?

41:13.240 --> 41:14.280
Well,

41:14.360 --> 41:16.240
Xindu is known for its majestic mountains.

41:16.320 --> 41:19.600
Having the wedding here
matches His Lordship's charisma.

41:20.120 --> 41:23.200
Xindu isn't as rich as Panyi.

41:23.280 --> 41:25.960
It was struck by war not long ago.

41:26.040 --> 41:27.680
Everything needs to be rebuilt.

41:27.760 --> 41:30.600
Panyi isn't as well-guarded as Xindu.

41:30.680 --> 41:32.600
This marriage is of great significance.

41:32.680 --> 41:33.960
It can't take any risks.

41:34.040 --> 41:35.520
The climate in Panyi is better.

41:35.600 --> 41:36.920
The temperature in Xindu is better.

41:37.000 --> 41:38.720
Panyi is Miss Xiaoqiao's hometown.

41:38.800 --> 41:40.400
Xindu is the territory of the Lord of Wei!

41:43.320 --> 41:44.320
Miss,

41:44.400 --> 41:46.560
why are they arguing over the venue?

41:48.560 --> 41:49.800
Wei requests

41:49.880 --> 41:52.600
that we hand over the Seal of Panyi
before the wedding.

41:53.280 --> 41:56.720
Our request is vice versa.

41:56.800 --> 41:59.400
What if they change their mind
after getting the seal?

41:59.480 --> 42:01.240
That's why we cannot compromise on that.

42:01.320 --> 42:02.480
Go.

42:05.000 --> 42:06.480
Xindu is shadowed by death.

42:08.320 --> 42:10.160
Fourteen years ago,

42:10.240 --> 42:12.960
tens of thousands were buried here.

42:16.360 --> 42:17.600
No need to discuss this further.

42:18.600 --> 42:19.760
If Yanzhou

42:20.240 --> 42:21.640
has no sincerity…

42:24.560 --> 42:26.400
then you may leave

42:28.080 --> 42:30.000
and take the bride back with you.
